{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d33f9af2bfec1f7b0a06b267c4893b13d0ee9f9a38c88c00fb89aad91b48a683",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87096b6b211f24d2e3a5b80900384eb15152fb0244d7e290ca6cdecd6d7e3535",
      "text": "好～嘞，今天也要好好练习啦。\n大家辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53be048e24f85177b99088c0992b3e7d7f36c0863f24eddc832528188b9a1cd5",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5a9e1dd1bebd7c3319aaba2130f94adebe4052e4337cd1dc0546c13326ab54e",
      "text": "唔咕、唔咕……咕嘟。\n呜！咳、咳咳、咳咳……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625d3e36fbf84ef7f88ac0bd8cf3a29f37a5741ac0619086efccbeed37c10766",
      "text": "真是的，你在干什么呢。\n来，喝茶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e5a050be5739d3e7ef11afabb54f63e22c149683b258528f0731e735e11d04b",
      "text": "抱歉，难道是我吓到你了吗？\n隼人，没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:236ec643c6009b02602a1c663e6fb410b066b36a192621c96b334467bca008a3",
      "text": "唔咕咕……咳，没事……\n只是不小心噎到了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9db6d7eeff748f7b04d612997ad12343975c6337a0545ca21a9c8ad71c0dd877",
      "text": "没事就好……嗯？\n那个盒子，难道你刚才在吃甜甜圈？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4511fb5889e09a9f1f019c8f6b29bf44fc1787c3a8cd25248253ba02baf28d03",
      "text": "没、没有啦，就是那样！\n受春名的影响，突然很想吃嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6083e3be28b468782964d2b9d33441b7a955e3168993134acaee10404394e7c",
      "text": "啊～…因为肚子饿了所以急急忙忙塞进嘴里了。\n啊哈，啊哈哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5ad04f7bbfae691507d4a21bccc36ad3893a1cac55ece93d2a3daa248327e0f",
      "text": "这样啊！隼人也体会到甜甜圈的美妙之处了啊。\n我也带了甜甜圈来，一起吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611359b1b1de8cac652d3598b810a97f06bae3efb30503f4a32d1a6305b19163",
      "text": "哎，我才刚吃完……\n没有啦，谢啦！我收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56bc01ff77cf63a85e477cda00aedbf4f4055e1f6493be4eca4808fbcb28621",
      "text": "多吃点补充体力吧！\n那我先去给架子鼓调音啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4e732435ceb006c565176fadc2ea6d429a7360cd9529c3ec9d6082afeda2b0",
      "text": "……呼，还好蒙混过去了。\n下次挑选甜甜圈得选好地方才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64602ae45ddcc9f1450f04c40a55042e8237d1cbbd5bbc641ad0f8aac80ab07",
      "text": "你蒙混的手段也太可疑了吧，隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
